;}</style>\r\n\t\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"https://shemetsberger.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/favicon.svg\" sizes=\"32x32\">\t</head>\r\n\t<body class=\"home wp-singular page-template-default page page-id-576 wp-theme-semplice7 is-frontend static-mode semplice-cursor gallery-cursor\"bgcolor=\"#000000\" data-post-type=\"page\" data-post-id=\"576\">\r\n\t\t\t<main id=\"content-holder\" data-active-post=\"576\">\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"content-576\" class=\"content-container active-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"transition-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sections\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<smp-section id=\"section_ae200cce9\" class=\"top-part\"  data-column-mode-sm=\"single\" data-column-mode-xs=\"single\" data-layout=\"fluid\" data-justify=\"space-between\" data-height=\"custom\" data-md-visibility=\"hide\" data-lg-visibility=\"hide\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-container>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-row id=\"row_a2c45960d\">\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_d765cbd89\" data-xl-width=\"3\" data-md-width=\"4\" data-lg-width=\"2\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_772673400\"  data-module=\"image\" ><div class=\"smp-image\" data-align=\"left\" data-width=\"original\"><div class=\"is-content\"><img class=\"\"  src=\"https://shemetsberger.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/shemetsberger_header_portrait.jpg-1.webp\" width=\"836\" height=\"1180\" alt=\"shemetsberger_header_portrait.jpg\" title=\"shemetsberger_header_portrait.jpg\" caption=\"\" data-scaling=\"no\"></div></div></smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_a35cf5f88\" data-xl-width=\"6\" data-md-width=\"5\" data-lg-width=\"4\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_1227f7b26\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><h1>I’m Sebastian, co-founder of <a title=\"Studio Nordost: Creative Studio focused on Design &amp; Photography\" href=\"https://studio-nordost.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-mce-href=\"https://studio-nordost.com/\">Studio Nordost</a>. I work hands-on across identity, UX, and front-end so design and delivery stay aligned.</h1></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_xkk3yem7r\" class=\"top-accordion\"  data-module=\"accordion\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"is-content\" data-seperator-visibility=\"visible\" data-seperator-mode=\"bottom\" data-accordion-id=\"content_xkk3yem7r\" data-mode=\"toggle\" data-has-gradient=\"false\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator top-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"accordion-item\" data-accordion-id=\"accordion_default1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-span\" data-name=\"title\"><span>More</span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"expand\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"16,7.5 8.5,7.5 8.5,0 7.5,0 7.5,7.5 0,7.5 0,8.5 7.5,8.5 7.5,16 8.5,16 8.5,8.5 16,8.5 \"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"collapse\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<rect x=\"7.5\" y=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(9.094953e-11 -1 1 9.094953e-11 -6.821210e-10 16)\" class=\"st0\" width=\"1\" height=\"16\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"description\" ><div class=\"description-inner\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\"><div id=\"accordion-content_o56m70l9g\" class=\"accordion-text accordion-content\"><div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">Independently and at Studio Nordost, I’ve led and contributed to projects for clients including Viiala<span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\"> (co-founded by former Audemars Piguet CEO François-Henri Bennahmias and former Stromer co-CEO Tomi Viiala)</span>, Stadt Salzburg, and Tapestry Energy <span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">(part of X, formerly Google X)</span>.&nbsp;</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">As a team, we frequently collaborate with partners including CoLab, Süd RLC, Salić, Merlicek &amp; Partner, and Raven &amp; Finch.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">Our work has received recognition from Awwwards, TDC Young Ones, the ADC Talent Award, and CCA Venus.</span></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator bottom-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_4931aulhb\" data-xl-width=\"3\" data-md-width=\"3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_erzu9kbge\" class=\"top-text\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p>Independently and at Studio Nordost, I’ve led and contributed to projects for clients including Viiala <span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">(co-founded by former Audemars Piguet CEO François-Henri Bennahmias and former Stromer co-CEO Tomi Viiala)</span>, Stadt Salzburg, and Tapestry Energy <span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">(part of X, formerly Google X)</span>.</p><p>As a team, we frequently collaborate with partners including <a data-mce-href=\"https://www.colabgroup.com/\" href=\"https://www.colabgroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CoLab</a>, <a data-mce-href=\"https://www.sudrlc.com/\" href=\"https://www.sudrlc.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Süd RLC</a>, <a data-mce-href=\"https://www.salic.at/\" href=\"https://www.salic.at/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Salić</a>, <a data-mce-href=\"https://merlicek-partner.at/\" href=\"https://merlicek-partner.at/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Merlicek &amp; Partner</a>, and <a data-mce-href=\"https://www.ravenandfinch.com/\" href=\"https://www.ravenandfinch.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Raven &amp; Finch</a>.</p><p>Our work has received recognition from Awwwards, TDC Young Ones, the ADC Talent Award, and CCA Venus.</p></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_2s6vebsaa\" class=\"top-accordion\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">Reach out at:</span> <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a data-mce-href=\"mailto:info@shemetsberger.com\" href=\"mailto:info@shemetsberger.com\">info@shemetsberger.com</a></span></p></div></smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column></smp-row></smp-container></smp-section>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-section id=\"section_eyslxalx2\"  data-column-mode-sm=\"single\" data-column-mode-xs=\"single\" data-layout=\"fluid\" data-justify=\"space-between\" data-sm-visibility=\"hide\" data-xs-visibility=\"hide\" data-lg-visibility=\"visible\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-container>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-row id=\"row_i1ymulby2\">\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_x2l0b6o9w\" data-md-width=\"6\" data-xl-width=\"6\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_0ddg4dwsi\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><h1>I’m Sebastian, co-founder of <a title=\"Studio Nordost: Creative Studio focused on Design &amp; Photography\" href=\"https://studio-nordost.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-mce-href=\"https://studio-nordost.com/\">Studio Nordost</a>. I work hands-on across identity, UX, and front-end so design and delivery stay aligned.</h1></div></smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_2p1uiw3b3\" data-xl-width=\"4\" data-md-width=\"5\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_v3zwetab2\"  data-module=\"accordion\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"is-content\" data-seperator-visibility=\"visible\" data-seperator-mode=\"bottom\" data-accordion-id=\"content_v3zwetab2\" data-mode=\"toggle\" data-has-gradient=\"false\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator top-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"accordion-item\" data-accordion-id=\"accordion_default1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-span\" data-name=\"title\"><span>More</span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"expand\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"16,7.5 8.5,7.5 8.5,0 7.5,0 7.5,7.5 0,7.5 0,8.5 7.5,8.5 7.5,16 8.5,16 8.5,8.5 16,8.5 \"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"collapse\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<rect x=\"7.5\" y=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(9.094953e-11 -1 1 9.094953e-11 -6.821210e-10 16)\" class=\"st0\" width=\"1\" height=\"16\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"description\" ><div class=\"description-inner\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\"><div id=\"accordion-content_m8r79j1j8\" class=\"accordion-text accordion-content\"><div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">Independently and at Studio Nordost, I’ve led and contributed to projects for clients including Viiala<span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\"> (co-founded by former Audemars Piguet CEO François-Henri Bennahmias and former Stromer co-CEO Tomi Viiala)</span>, Stadt Salzburg, and Tapestry Energy <span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">(part of X, formerly Google X)</span>.&nbsp;</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">As a team, we frequently collaborate with partners including CoLab, Süd RLC, Salić, Merlicek &amp; Partner, and Raven &amp; Finch.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\">Our work has received recognition from Awwwards, TDC Young Ones, the ADC Talent Award, and CCA Venus.</span></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator bottom-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column></smp-row></smp-container></smp-section>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-section id=\"section_f5bfcda67\" class=\"infobar-desktop\"  data-column-mode-sm=\"single\" data-column-mode-xs=\"single\" data-layout=\"fluid\" data-height=\"custom\" data-valign=\"center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-container>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-row id=\"row_440f61ff2\">\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_4cc8ffee2\" data-xl-width=\"3\" data-lg-width=\"3\" data-md-width=\"6\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_a64807f9c\" class=\"hide-mobile\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p data-font-size-md=\"0.778rem\" data-line-he