t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_8e9a0875d\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><h2>Apotheke Laa’s rebrand puts science at the center while staying warm and approachable.</h2></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_e4aa3b9fe\"  data-module=\"accordion\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"is-content\" data-seperator-visibility=\"visible\" data-seperator-mode=\"bottom\" data-accordion-id=\"content_e4aa3b9fe\" data-mode=\"normal\" data-has-gradient=\"false\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator top-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"accordion-item\" data-accordion-id=\"accordion_default1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-span\" data-name=\"title\"><span>More</span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"expand\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"16,7.5 8.5,7.5 8.5,0 7.5,0 7.5,7.5 0,7.5 0,8.5 7.5,8.5 7.5,16 8.5,16 8.5,8.5 16,8.5 \"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"collapse\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<rect x=\"7.5\" y=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(9.094953e-11 -1 1 9.094953e-11 -6.821210e-10 16)\" class=\"st0\" width=\"1\" height=\"16\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"description\" ><div class=\"description-inner\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\"><div id=\"accordion-content_ry560u0hl\" class=\"accordion-text accordion-content\"><div>We designed custom letterforms with points and connections that echo molecular structures—creating instant recognition and a clear scientific cue, even without the logo. The result distinguishes the pharmacy from drugstores and reflects its professional, research-driven backbone.</div></div></div></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator bottom-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_f698b1a51\" data-xl-width=\"3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_0515f8fad\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">Scope</span><br>Brand Identity<br>Website<br>Typography<br></p></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_7473e3b3d\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">Brand<br></span>Alexander Merlicek<br>Denise Hödl<br>Sebastian Hemetsberger<br></p></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_c741612fc\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">Website</span><br>Alexander Merlicek<br>Sebastian Hemetsberger<br></p></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_82ef0ecc7\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\">Typedesign</span><br>Displaay<br>Sebastian Hemetsberger<br></p></div></smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_567615c59\" data-xl-width=\"3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_4c12ee267\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><p><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 234, 234);\" data-mce-style=\"color: rgb(234, 