smp-column id=\"column_vmt0yemm6\" data-xl-width=\"3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_44e78548a\"  data-module=\"video\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"smp-video is-content hide-controls smp-autoplay\">\n\t\t\t\t<video class=\"video\" preload=\"metadata\"  webkit-playsinline playsinline loop muted autoplay>\n\t\t\t\t\t<source src=\"https://shemetsberger.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/shemetsberger_markus-beham_03.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\t\t\t\t</video>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_575m7vt8g\" data-xl-width=\"3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_jue0aauhh\"  data-module=\"image\" ><div class=\"smp-image\" data-align=\"left\" data-width=\"original\"><div class=\"is-content\"><img class=\"\"  src=\"https://shemetsberger.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/shemetsberger_markus-beham_04.jpg\" width=\"804\" height=\"1102\" alt=\"shemetsberger_markus-beham_04\" title=\"shemetsberger_markus-beham_04\" caption=\"\" data-scaling=\"no\"></div></div></smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column></smp-row><smp-row id=\"row_9dc9122e3\">\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_ed7fa727b\" data-xl-width=\"6\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content id=\"content_8649c26dd\"  data-module=\"text\" ><div class=\"is-content\"><h2>Beham Films crafts cinematic stories with a mix of creativity, precision, and empathy—work that moves people.</h2></div></smp-content><smp-content id=\"content_95c1d435f\"  data-module=\"accordion\" >\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"is-content\" data-seperator-visibility=\"visible\" data-seperator-mode=\"bottom\" data-accordion-id=\"content_95c1d435f\" data-mode=\"normal\" data-has-gradient=\"false\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator top-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"accordion-item\" data-accordion-id=\"accordion_default1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title-span\" data-name=\"title\"><span>More</span></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"expand\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<polygon class=\"st0\" points=\"16,7.5 8.5,7.5 8.5,0 7.5,0 7.5,7.5 0,7.5 0,8.5 7.5,8.5 7.5,16 8.5,16 8.5,8.5 16,8.5 \"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"collapse\"><svg version=\"1.1\" id=\"Ebene_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\"\r\n\t viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 16 16;\" xml:space=\"preserve\">\r\n<rect x=\"7.5\" y=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(9.094953e-11 -1 1 9.094953e-11 -6.821210e-10 16)\" class=\"st0\" width=\"1\" height=\"16\"/>\r\n</svg>\r\n</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"description\" ><div class=\"description-inner\" data-font=\"font_q7il9b6yr\"><div id=\"accordion-content_yvnysup0u\" class=\"accordion-text accordion-content\"><div>We built a brand identity and website around that ethos, using the cinematic threshold where stills become motion (25 fps) as a guiding idea. Clear structure, restrained typography, and subtle motion cues keep the focus on storytelling.</div></div></div></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"seperator bottom-seperator\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</smp-content></smp-content-wrapper></smp-column>\r\n\t\t\t<smp-column id=\"column_dacaba3cb\" data-xl-width=\"3\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<smp-content-wrapper>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<smp-content