e-href=\\\"https://merlicek-partner.at/\\\" href=\\\"https://merlicek-partner.at/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003EMerlicek &amp; Partner\\u003C/a\\u003E, and \\u003Ca data-mce-href=\\\"https://www.ravenandfinch.com/\\\" href=\\\"https://www.ravenandfinch.com/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\\u003ERaven &amp; Finch\\u003C/a\\u003E.\\u003C/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EOur work has received recognition from Awwwards, TDC Young Ones, the ADC Talent Award, and CCA Venus.\\u003C/p\\u003E\"},\"module\":\"text\",\"options\":[],\"styles\":{\"xl\":{\"padding-top\":\"1.7777777777777777rem\"},\"xs\":[],\"sm\":[],\"md\":[]},\"motions\":{\"active\":[],\"start\":[],\"end\":[]},\"classes\":\"top-text\"},\"content_xkk3yem7r\":{\"content\":{\"xl\":{\"items\":{\"accordion_default1\":{\"title\":\"\\u003Cspan\\u003EMore\\u003C/span\\u003E\",\"content\":{\"accordion-content_o56m70l9g\":{\"html\":\"\\u003Cdiv\\u003E\\u003Cdiv\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\\\"\\u003EIndependently and at Studio Nordost, I\\u2019ve led and contributed to projects for clients including Viiala\\u003Cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\\\"\\u003E (co-founded by former Audemars Piguet CEO Fran\\u00e7ois-Henri Bennahmias and former Stromer co-CEO Tomi Viiala)\\u003C/span\\u003E, Stadt Salzburg, and Tapestry Energy \\u003Cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(127, 127, 127);\\\"\\u003E(part of X, formerly Google X)\\u003C/span\\u003E.&nbsp;\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/div\\u003E\\u003Cdiv\\u003E&nbsp;\\u003C/div\\u003E\\u003Cdiv\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\\\"\\u003EAs a team, we frequently collaborate with partners including CoLab, S\\u00fcd RLC, Sali\\u0107, Merlicek &amp; Partner, and Raven &amp; Finch.\\u003C/span\\u003E\\u003C/div\\u003E\\u003Cdiv\\u003E&nbsp;\\u003C/div\\u003E\\u003Cdiv\\u003E\\u003Cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(230, 230, 230);\\\"\\u003EOur work has received recognition from Awwwards, TDC Young Ones, the ADC Talent Award,