.jpg 2560w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\" >        </picture>\n\n        \n\n                                                </div>\n                                            \n                                            <p class=\"h2 secondary-color\">Jacob Berger, 3D Fox</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                                                                    <div class=\"entry\">\n                            <div class=\"testimonial card-wrapper\">\n                                                                    <div class=\"profile-pic show-sm\">\n                                        \n\n    \n    \n        <picture>\n            \n            <source srcset=\"https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-300x-q80.webp 300w, https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-600x-q80.webp 600w, https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-900x-q80.webp 900w, https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-1200x-q80.webp 1200w, https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-1800x-q80.webp 1800w, https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-2560x-q90.webp 2560w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 25vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" type=\"image/webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-300x.jpg\" srcset=\"https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-300x-q80.jpg 300w, https://studio-nordost.com/media/pages/start/aae594793a-1775733087/tobias_woegerer-600x-q80.jpg 600w, https://studio-nordost